  vendorName: Cook Alden
  offerText: Buy a bowl of my hot, hearty vegetable stew. It costs only a few coins,
    but it will warm your bones and restore your physical strength immediately.
  acceptResultText: You eat the delicious stew. Your stomach is full, and you feel
    a wonderful surge of healthy energy returning to your tired body.
  rejectResultText: You refuse the hot meal to save your money. Your stomach rumbles
    loudly, leaving you weak, hungry, and shivering.
